# The rows of src/runtime/recipes/vulpen/library/parts/panes/Panes.cpp, a call each (src/tools/bench/bench.py).

## Panes.cpp/Panes::bind
interact maybe -> throws runtime_error: "param interact = maybe: yes or no"
interact, to and keys unset -> asked ["input typed", "output buttons"]; buttons interact > ide: param set ide.panes interact yes
no keys connected -> asked ["output buttons"]; buttons interact > ide: param set ide.panes interact yes
pane empty -> throws runtime_error: "ide.panes needs a pane, the rooms and the pictures of it, as image.area"
pictures empty -> throws runtime_error: "ide.panes needs a pane, the rooms and the pictures of it, as image.area"
rooms empty -> throws runtime_error: "ide.panes needs a pane, the rooms and the pictures of it, as image.area"
the ide's, interact no -> asked ["input typed", "output buttons"]; buttons interact > ide: param set ide.panes interact yes
the ide's, interact yes -> asked ["input typed", "output buttons"]; buttons interact > ide: param unset ide.panes interact, current

