to a.b,c.d -> 1 ["ide: node add ide.p1-pane recipe=still-image", "ide: node move ide.p1-pane ide.panes", "ide: connect p1-pane-room ide.deck.p1 ide.p1-pane.image.area", "ide: node add ide.p2-pane recipe=still-image", "ide: node move ide.p2-pane ide.panes", "ide: connect p2-pane-room ide.deck.p2 ide.p2-pane.image.area", "ide: disconnect typed", "ide: connect typed ide.keys.typed ide.panes.typed", "ide: connect present p2: a.b c.d ide.p2-pane.image.picture"]; 2 []
two decks, a window to p2's pane while p2 is presented -> 1 ["ide: disconnect window-p2-pane"]; 2 []
two decks, p1's window not connected -> 1 ["ide: connect window-p1-pane p1:  ide.p1-pane.image.picture ide.p1-pane.still.picture"]; 2 []

